About Demogorgon and Pestilance, I was a bit worried that limiting the
use of unicorn horns would make those guys too dangerous - so I put in
a special Sickness clause in the unicorn horn cure probability (as you
can see in the code I posted earlier). So even if you're unicorn horn
is completely depleted, it can still cure sickness reliably enough for
you to survive a fight with those guys. So I don't think it will make
it much harder with the current numbers. But, I expect that I'll
reduce the probability bonus a little bit in the future after I've had
a few games to test it. Ultimately I want the horn to be good enough
to rely on for curing sickness, but not so good that the player
doesn't get the fear of death put into them!

